%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8c1a70fcd7e8f8c42920e122a812509f, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryData 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  dialogues:
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Nua hammered the new rim into place while Mocha held the wheel steady.
        The wagon was ready to roll again.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB204\uC544\uAC00 \uC0C8 \uBC14\uD034 \uD14C\uB97C \uB450\uB4DC\uB824
        \uB07C\uC6B0\uACE0 \uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00 \uBC14\uD034\uB97C \uBD99\uC7A1\uC558\uB2E4.
        \uC218\uB808\uB294 \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC6C0\uC9C1\uC77C \uC900\uBE44\uB97C \uB9C8\uCCE4\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: -8000596390684728517, guid: 607807caba3f0d540925c77c91b174e4, type: 3}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Mocha
      dialogue: That should hold up even on the marsh road!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uBAA8\uCE74"
      dialogue: "\uC774 \uC815\uB3C4\uBA74 \uB2AA\uAE38\uB3C4 \uBC84\uD2F0\uACA0\uC9C0!"
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha and Nua laid their finished ingots on the counter. The merchant
        weighed them with a grin.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uC640 \uB204\uC544\uB294 \uBC18\uB4EF\uD558\uAC8C \uB9CC\uB4E0
        \uC8FC\uAD34\uB97C \uB178\uC810\uC5D0 \uC62C\uB838\uB2E4. \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740
        \uBB34\uAC8C\uB97C \uC7AC\uBA70 \uC6C3\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: Fine work. Still a little short of that key, though.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uBB3C\uAC74\uC740 \uC88B\uB124. \uC5F4\uC1E0\uB294 \uC544\uC9C1
        \uC880 \uBAA8\uC790\uB77C\uC9C0\uB9CC."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: The merchant pointed at the higher price, then produced a torn, soaking-wet
        cover.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uB354 \uC624\uB978 \uC5F4\uC1E0\uAC12\uC744
        \uAC00\uB9AC\uD0A4\uB354\uB2C8 \uC816\uACE0 \uCC22\uC5B4\uC9C4 \uB36E\uAC1C\uB97C
        \uB0B4\uBC00\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: You'll need waterproofing to cross the marsh. Bring me monster-scale
        essence.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uB2AA\uC744 \uAC74\uB108\uB824\uBA74 \uBC29\uC218\uC81C\uAC00 \uD544\uC694\uD574.
        \uB9C8\uBB3C \uBE44\uB298 \uC815\uC218\uB97C \uAC00\uC838\uC640."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: In the marsh, Nocti was brewing an essence in a small flask. As the
        water rose, Nua braced the table and Mocha held off the enemies.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB2AA\uC758 \uB179\uD2F0\uB294 \uC791\uC740 \uD50C\uB77C\uC2A4\uD06C\uB85C
        \uC815\uC218\uB97C \uB9CC\uB4E4\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uBB3C\uC774 \uC791\uC5C5\uB300\uAE4C\uC9C0
        \uCC28\uC624\uB974\uC790 \uB204\uC544\uAC00 \uBC1B\uCE68\uC744 \uC138\uC6B0\uACE0
        \uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00 \uC801\uC744 \uB9C9\uC558\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 3870107277556667874, guid: 14b1de42f0c1a7547a84a35461671803, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Nocti
      dialogue: Hold on a little longer. It's almost ready!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB179\uD2F0"
      dialogue: "\uC870\uAE08\uB9CC \uBC84\uD168 \uC918\uC694. \uAC70\uC758 \uB2E4
        \uB410\uC5B4\uC694!"
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Nocti connected the copper tube, and green essence dripped into the
        receiving flask. Mocha readied a piece of canvas.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uB179\uD2F0\uAC00 \uAD6C\uB9AC \uAD00\uC744 \uC5F0\uACB0\uD558\uC790
        \uCD08\uB85D \uC815\uC218\uAC00 \uD55C \uBC29\uC6B8\uC529 \uB5A8\uC5B4\uC84C\uB2E4.
        \uBAA8\uCE74\uB294 \uB36E\uAC1C\uC5D0 \uBC14\uB97C \uCC9C\uC744 \uC900\uBE44\uD588\uB2E4."
  - background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 73c493a0b3ab6e04baa54aba9cf2ef31, type: 3}
    leftCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    rightCharacter: {fileID: 3870107277556667874, guid: 14b1de42f0c1a7547a84a35461671803, type: 3}
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Nocti
      dialogue: Coat it with this, and the water should stay out.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB179\uD2F0"
      dialogue: "\uC774\uAC78 \uBC14\uB974\uBA74 \uBB3C\uC774 \uC2A4\uBA70\uB4E4\uC9C0
        \uC54A\uC744 \uAC70\uC608\uC694."
